/target
/result
/result-*
tests/corpus/*
!tests/corpus/.gitkeep

# spikes/ (M0.2, docs/adr/001-ui-toolkit.md): each spike/lib builds its
# own target dir and may produce its own result symlink.
spikes/*/target
spikes/*/result
spikes/*/result-*
spikes/result
spikes/result-*

# crates/eda-ui/fuzz/ (M0.3): its own `[workspace]`, outside the root
# workspace's /target, per the standard cargo-fuzz layout. A real fuzzing
# campaign (cargo fuzz run) also writes corpus/ and artifacts/ dirs here;
# neither belongs in version control.
crates/eda-ui/fuzz/target
crates/eda-ui/fuzz/corpus
crates/eda-ui/fuzz/artifacts
